IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cra-types`
IMPORT `cra-goods`

-- Consumer Rights Act 2015 (UK) — GOAL 3: SERVICES (ss 54-56).
-- Source: ../registers/source-bundle/ukpga-2015-15.txt.

§ `Goal 3 — services`

-- s 54(3): for a non-conforming service, "(a) the right to require repeat
-- performance ...; (b) the right to a price reduction". s 55(3) "The
-- consumer cannot require repeat performance if completing performance of the
-- service in conformity with the contract is impossible."
@ref ss 54(3), 55(3)
@export Whether a consumer can require repeat performance of a service under ss 54-55 of the Consumer Rights Act 2015 (UK): the service did not conform to the contract and completing it in conformity is not impossible. DRAFT, not reviewed by a UK lawyer.
GIVEN s IS A `Service facts`  @desc Whether the service conformed and whether completing it is impossible
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `repeat performance can be required for` s IF
        s's `does not conform`
    AND NOT (s's `completing performance in conformity is impossible`)

-- s 56(3) "A consumer who has that right and the right to require repeat
-- performance is only entitled to a price reduction in one of these
-- situations— (a) because of section 55(3) the consumer cannot require
-- repeat performance; or (b) the consumer has required repeat performance,
-- but the trader is in breach of the requirement ... to do it within a
-- reasonable time and without significant inconvenience".
@ref ss 54(3), 56(3)
@export Whether a consumer is entitled to a price reduction for a service under ss 54 and 56 of the Consumer Rights Act 2015 (UK): the service did not conform, and either repeat performance is impossible or the trader failed to perform again within a reasonable time without significant inconvenience. DRAFT, not reviewed by a UK lawyer.
GIVEN s IS A `Service facts`  @desc Whether the service conformed, whether completing it is impossible, and whether repeat performance was required but not given in time
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a price reduction is available for` s IF
        s's `does not conform`
    AND (   s's `completing performance in conformity is impossible`
         OR s's `repeat performance required but not given within a reasonable time`)
